(rigid-body-glider)
*title Source-driven rigid-body glider family smoke test
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*runtime status vehicle reference-area=5.0 reference-length=2.0 inertia-x=20 inertia-y=30 inertia-z=40 dry-mass-kg=100
*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=1000 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=3600
*runtime status thermal policy=none

*trajectory 1 glider start on 1
  *initial ecic x=7000000 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=1000 zdt=0 time=0 mass=100 propellant_mass=0
  *segment 1 glide
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.01
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) cmx=(cmx) cmy=(cmy) cmz=(cmz)
    *fly alpha=0
    *when time>0.2 stop
*end
